{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "editable": false,
  "title": "① Index Optimization — Product List v1~v4",
  "uid": "flashdeal-index",
  "tags": ["flashdeal", "phase3-1", "index"],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "time": { "from": "now-30m", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "버전별(uri 라벨) 처리량. v1=no index … v4=composite. 부하: test/load/index-test.js (VERSION env로 라우트 전환). actuator http_server_requests_seconds_count.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["last", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{uri=~\"/api/v[0-9]+/products\"}[1m]))", "legendFormat": "{{uri}}", "refId": "A" }
      ],
      "title": "Throughput (req/s) by version",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "서버측 평균 지연 = rate(_sum)/rate(_count). 주의: Spring Actuator Timer는 percentiles-histogram 미설정 시 _bucket을 발행하지 않아 서버측 '진짜 p95' 산출 불가 → 평균(avg)으로 비교. 클라이언트 p95는 k6 http_req_duration(런 단위 글로벌) 참조.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["last", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_sum{uri=~\"/api/v[0-9]+/products\"}[1m])) / sum by (uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{uri=~\"/api/v[0-9]+/products\"}[1m]))", "legendFormat": "{{uri}} avg", "refId": "A" }
      ],
      "title": "평균 서버 지연 avg by version",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "버전별 최대 지연(꼬리 근사). Actuator가 발행하는 _max 게이지(직전 윈도우 최댓값).",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["last", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "max by (uri) (http_server_requests_seconds_max{uri=~\"/api/v[0-9]+/products\"})", "legendFormat": "{{uri}} max", "refId": "A" }
      ],
      "title": "Max 지연 by version (tail proxy)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ]
}
